id=hydra_zygisk_rot_spoof
name=hydra Zygisk RootOfTrust Spoof (adversarial)
version=v0.1
versionCode=1
author=hydra adversarial suite
description=Research ONLY. Native Zygisk module. In io.ssemaj.raven.sample ONLY, GOT-hooks ioctl and rewrites the KeyMint attestation RootOfTrust verifiedBootState (SelfSigned->Verified) in the binder reply DER (setprop hydra.rot.mode bs|full|off). No-op for every other app. Tests whether DeviceIntelligence survives an in-process boot-state spoof. Do NOT ship.
